"\n"
"Why it helps: this is the strongest compatibility fix when both Delay and Defer are still too late.\n"
"\n"
"Watch for: it gives up more speed than Defer Instead. When a script is added here, UltraCache removes overlapping entries from the Defer Instead list so the two boxes do not fight."
