msgid "Aggressive Async CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10211
msgid "Optional advanced mode. Rewrite almost all remaining local stylesheet links, including late footer output, to non-blocking print+onload loading with a noscript fallback. Use the exclude list for styles that must stay blocking."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10222
msgid "Fonts Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10223
msgid "Optimize remote Google Fonts, local @font-face display behavior, self-hosted font CSS delivery, and optional delayed icon-font loading."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10228
msgid "Font Display Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10229
msgid "Adds font-display: swap to local @font-face declarations when missing and appends display=swap to remote Google Fonts requests. Uses the existing Google Fonts Swap setting internally for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10236
msgid "Local Google Fonts Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10237
msgid "Opt-in feature. Download Google Fonts CSS and WOFF2 files into the UltraCache cache, rewrite frontend Google Fonts links and Google Fonts @import rules found in loaded same-origin CSS, and keep font-display: swap on localized CSS. This feature makes outbound requests to Google Fonts when building the local cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10248
msgid "Optimize Self-Hosted Font CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10249
msgid "Rewrite local and inline @font-face CSS to add font-display: swap, prefer matching WOFF2 sources when available, normalize font URLs, and preload up to two likely first-paint WOFF2 files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10256
msgid "Bundle Generated Font-Mix CSS"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10257
msgid "Consolidate UltraCache-generated optimized-css/css-font-mix stylesheets into one ordered blocking CSS file. This reduces render-blocking request count without asyncing layout-risk CSS."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10261
msgid ""
"What it does: combines UltraCache-generated font-mix CSS files into one ordered stylesheet.\n"
"\n"
"Why it helps: the browser has one font CSS request to handle instead of many small blocking requests.\n"
"\n"
"Watch for: this bundle stays blocking on purpose because font CSS can change text size, icon display, and first-view layout."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10265
msgid "Async Generated Font-Mix CSS Bundle"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10266
msgid "Load the consolidated bundle-font-mix stylesheet with non-blocking print+onload delivery. Individual css-font-mix source files are not async-loaded by this option."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10270
msgid ""
"What it does: async-loads only the single consolidated bundle-font-mix stylesheet.\n"
"\n"
"Why it helps: a large font-mix bundle can leave the render-blocking path, so the page can paint sooner.\n"
"\n"
"Watch for: text or icons may appear with fallback styling first and settle later. Check the first viewport, product cards, menus, headers, and decorative fonts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10274
msgid "Delay icon fonts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10275
msgid "Moves only matching entries from the visible font pattern list into a non-render-blocking delayed font stylesheet. Use the scanner to append detected icon-font patterns, then save the visible list."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10282
msgid "Advanced Runtime Font CSS Rewrite"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10283
msgid "Advanced opt-in / experimental. Uses a MutationObserver to rewrite late-injected local font stylesheet links. Keep off unless a site specifically needs runtime font-link rewriting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10294
msgid "WooCommerce Controls"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10295
msgid "Control WooCommerce cache safety, frontend request timing, and optional asset cleanup."
msgstr ""

