msgid "Enable WooCommerce asset cleanup"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10363
msgid "Cleans selected unnecessary WooCommerce frontend assets from cached HTML and late WordPress queues. Test homepage, shop, product, cart, checkout, and header search after enabling."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-dashboard.js:10364
